# Manifest-render cache written by scripts/lib/gitops.py (CACHE_DIR).
# Content-addressed, regenerated on demand — never source.
#
# The root .gitignore is generated by `flext_infra codegen conform`, and the
# regeneration to the pinned owner dropped the `.gitops-cache/` rule it used to
# carry, exposing 88 cache files. A rule re-added to the root file is lost on
# the next `make gen`; this nested file is project-owned and survives.
*
!.gitignore
